/P 123 0 R
/T (A calorie deficit happens when you consume fewer calories than your body needs for its current weight. This forces your body to use stored energy, like fat, to make up the difference. Through consistency you can achieve gradual, sustainable weight loss. )
/E (A calorie deficit happens when you consume fewer calories than your body needs for its current weight. This forces your body to use stored energy, like fat, to make up the difference. Through consistency you can achieve gradual, sustainable weight loss. )
